[00:12.86]1. Life depends on Jehovah’s Word,
[00:18.91]All the things he has said.
[00:24.96]We must live not on bread alone;
[00:30.46]Live by his Word instead.
[00:37.15]Even now we have peace and joy,
[00:43.20]Future blessings assured.
[00:46.22](Chorus)
[00:49.24]Man must live not on bread alone;
[00:55.24]Life depends on God’s Word.
[01:01.53]There we find what we daily need;
[01:07.27]Life depends on God’s Word.
[01:14.01]2. True accounts in God’s written Word
[01:19.85]Tell about those of old.
[01:26.11]Men and women who walked in faith—
[01:32.11]They were loyal and bold.
[01:38.30]We’re encouraged each time we read
[01:44.50]All they did and endured.
[01:47.50](Chorus)
[01:50.49]Man must live not on bread alone;
[01:56.49]Life depends on God’s Word.
[02:02.49]There we find what we daily need;
[02:08.49]Life depends on God’s Word.
[02:37.72]3. Day by day as we read God’s Word,
[02:44.35]He gives comfort and hope.
[02:50.97]When the trials of life arise,
[02:57.57]He gives wisdom to cope.
[03:04.22]May we treasure within our heart
[03:10.94]All we’ve read and we’ve heard.
[03:14.01](Chorus)
[03:17.08]Man must live not on bread alone;
[03:23.08]Life depends on God’s Word.
[03:29.38]There we find what we daily need;
[03:39.26]Life depends on God’s Word.